WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:07.799
[moody, intense intro music plays]

01:10.111 --> 01:12.280
I think the left side
should be a little lower than that.

01:12.363 --> 01:16.034
[man] Move it to the left. A little down.
That's right. Looking real good.

01:16.117 --> 01:18.953
JOO YEO-JEONG PLASTIC SURGERY

01:25.710 --> 01:27.629
[Yeo-jeong] Is it okay if I touch you?

01:29.005 --> 01:30.340
I don't want to startle you.

01:32.717 --> 01:34.719
[gentle music playing]

01:44.562 --> 01:48.066
The button on my sleeve fell off
when I went to the car mechanic's.

01:48.983 --> 01:50.318
Crawling on the floor

01:51.486 --> 01:52.904
like I was crazy.

01:56.491 --> 01:57.909
Aren't they hard to look at?

01:58.910 --> 01:59.828
My scars?

02:00.954 --> 02:01.871
They're injuries.

02:07.418 --> 02:09.254
But if you collapse like that again,

02:09.337 --> 02:10.839
call me so you won't be alone.

02:11.464 --> 02:13.716
I can understand
the burden that anger can be.

02:14.884 --> 02:16.386
I've been there before.

02:22.267 --> 02:24.310
Just wait here.
I'll put a new button on for you.

02:35.572 --> 02:36.573
Sit.

02:52.589 --> 02:53.590
Just trust me.

02:54.299 --> 02:56.467
My sewing is better than
most tailors out there.

03:07.896 --> 03:08.897
Who was it?

03:10.523 --> 03:12.692
The person you needed me
to help beat at Go?

03:16.070 --> 03:19.199
[operator] The person you are
trying to reach is unavailable.

03:31.753 --> 03:32.921
There you are.

03:33.838 --> 03:35.715
I thought you weren't home yet.

03:35.798 --> 03:36.758
I'm off to work.

03:36.841 --> 03:37.842
[lighter clinks]

03:38.843 --> 03:39.844
[lighter clinks]

03:41.346 --> 03:42.555
What's this?

03:42.639 --> 03:44.224
Taking a trip down memory lane?

03:44.307 --> 03:47.227
Oh honey, I didn't think
you'd be the one to dig this out.

03:47.310 --> 03:49.229
They're your friends from high school.

03:51.898 --> 03:54.234
[laughs] Before Hye-jeong
got all that work done.

03:55.151 --> 03:57.654
Well, maybe I should get a boob job too.
Do you think I should?

03:57.737 --> 03:59.489
Son Myeong-o isn't in this picture.

04:01.783 --> 04:02.784
Oh, he's not.

04:05.495 --> 04:08.498
But, honey, how do you know Myeong-o?

04:09.207 --> 04:12.627
Do you often see Jae-jun or Myeong-o?

04:14.879 --> 04:15.755
Sometimes.

04:15.838 --> 04:18.466
Whenever I have a fitting,
I do it at Jae-jun's shop.

04:19.926 --> 04:22.220
But I haven't talked to Myeong-o lately.

04:24.597 --> 04:26.015
Ugh, oh my God.

04:26.516 --> 04:29.060
Sometimes, he does
some really weird stuff.

04:29.686 --> 04:33.147
Did Myeong-o say anything at all odd?
Did he threaten you at all?

04:33.731 --> 04:34.732
What'd he say?

04:35.316 --> 04:36.484
[chuckles dryly]

04:38.069 --> 04:39.612
You and your friends

04:39.696 --> 04:41.698
aren't acting normal right now.

04:42.615 --> 04:45.743
Son Myeong-o comes up,
and you all ask if I was threatened.

04:46.828 --> 04:48.037
Get to work safely.

04:53.084 --> 04:54.085
[door closes]

04:55.086 --> 04:56.796
[mysterious music playing]

04:56.879 --> 04:59.173
[touchscreen input chiming]

05:06.931 --> 05:10.143
RECENT DESTINATIONS
PLATINUM CC

05:10.893 --> 05:12.395
Did he and Jae-jun meet up?

05:14.063 --> 05:16.065
[ominous music building]

05:24.866 --> 05:26.034
[Dong-eun] Ha Do-yeong.

05:26.534 --> 05:28.077
At Jaepyeong Construction.

05:29.120 --> 05:30.371
And he's Yeon-jin's husband.

05:31.831 --> 05:33.958
Why are you interested
in her husband, then?

05:37.837 --> 05:40.006
When I finally get my revenge some day,

05:41.341 --> 05:44.594
Yeong-jin will have
nobody who can be at her side.

05:46.429 --> 05:49.265
Not even her daughter or her husband.

05:50.308 --> 05:51.517
She'll have no one left.

05:53.186 --> 05:55.188
No one she has loved left.

06:05.406 --> 06:08.409
So did you win your match?

06:10.870 --> 06:11.704
Yeah, I won,

06:13.081 --> 06:14.374
but because I had a good teacher.

06:14.457 --> 06:15.458
[chuckles]

06:19.796 --> 06:22.715
The passcode is seven-two-four, Dong-eun.

06:22.799 --> 06:24.967
[gentle Korean pop ballad playing]

06:28.262 --> 06:30.098
It may take us months or years,

06:30.598 --> 06:32.558
but let's play Go together again.

06:33.976 --> 06:38.147
I'll make a move, and then you can come
whenever you can and make your move.

06:39.107 --> 06:41.359
That way, I'll know you were here.

06:42.360 --> 06:45.196
So then it's okay
if you don't answer my calls.

06:45.279 --> 06:46.948
Just let me know how you are.

06:47.615 --> 06:49.033
That's all I'll ever need.

06:50.952 --> 06:53.788
And then after all of this,
I'll do what you want.

06:55.081 --> 06:56.666
I'll do anything for you.

06:58.960 --> 07:01.045
I'll happily be your executioner.

07:01.546 --> 07:03.548
[gentle pop ballad continuing]

07:15.685 --> 07:17.728
YEONHWADANG

07:20.440 --> 07:22.024
[woman] Please sign in here.

07:24.444 --> 07:26.571
[indistinct chatter]

07:29.198 --> 07:31.200
[tense, mischievous music playing]

07:36.205 --> 07:37.206
Hi there.

07:38.124 --> 07:41.002
Is this unusual,
so many young women here now?

07:41.878 --> 07:42.962
The shaman that good?

07:43.754 --> 07:45.965
I can't really say. First time.

07:46.466 --> 07:49.218
I heard from my friend
who was here before,

07:49.302 --> 07:51.262
she'll solve any problem you bring her.

07:52.054 --> 07:53.598
Any problem, huh?

07:55.558 --> 07:57.310
Who do we have here, huh?

07:57.393 --> 07:58.561
Ms. Kang Hyeon-a?

08:00.646 --> 08:02.148
Ms. Kang Hyeon-a?

08:03.149 --> 08:04.233
Kang Hyeon-a!

08:04.317 --> 08:06.527
Here! I'm here.
That's me, right there. Here.

08:12.283 --> 08:14.744
Do you think you can get it out? It's oil.

08:14.827 --> 08:15.828
Sure, I can.

08:18.706 --> 08:21.334
And I can even sew on
a new button for you.

08:23.711 --> 08:24.712
Oh, just…

08:27.298 --> 08:28.299
leave it like that.

08:30.092 --> 08:31.344
[knocking at door]

08:31.427 --> 08:32.428
[door opens]

08:33.054 --> 08:36.265
[assistant] I sent a plant to congratulate
Dr. Joo on his new practice.

08:36.349 --> 08:38.976
And this is all the mail
that came in today.

08:39.060 --> 08:40.061
Oh, thank you.

08:41.604 --> 08:42.438
God.

08:43.397 --> 08:45.191
You think he's sent his credit card bills?

08:45.274 --> 08:46.275
[chuckles]

09:00.164 --> 09:01.541
[mug shattering]

09:04.001 --> 09:06.003
[suspenseful music playing]

09:08.506 --> 09:12.760
CHEONGSONG PRISON
KANG YEONG-CHEON

09:12.843 --> 09:14.428
PATIENT MURDERS A HOSPITAL DIRECTOR

09:14.512 --> 09:16.222
SERIAL KILLER KANG ARRESTED ON SITE

09:26.774 --> 09:28.901
TO DR. JOO
HELLO, THIS IS KANG YEONG-CHEON

09:31.946 --> 09:32.905
YOUR FATHER WAS A GOOD MAN

09:32.989 --> 09:34.448
THE SMELL OF BLOOD
WHEN THE KNIFE PIERCED HIS NECK

09:34.532 --> 09:36.325
THE VESSELS BURST
THE WHITES OF HIS EYES TURNED RED

09:36.409 --> 09:37.660
That son of a…

09:40.246 --> 09:41.247
[whimpers]

09:43.499 --> 09:44.500
That son of a…

09:49.255 --> 09:51.257
[whimpering, panting]

10:07.106 --> 10:08.107
[music trails off]

10:27.543 --> 10:29.462
Hmm…

10:29.545 --> 10:31.547
[low, menacing music builds]

10:39.138 --> 10:41.098
[menacing music intensifies]

10:50.608 --> 10:53.277
One-hundred-eighty-two centimeters.

10:54.528 --> 10:56.322
And 75 kilograms.

10:58.616 --> 11:00.618
[flesh rending, blood gushing]

11:31.399 --> 11:32.608
[sighs heavily]

11:38.739 --> 11:40.741
[menacing music swells, trails off]

11:40.825 --> 11:43.202
[tinny, upbeat religious music playing]

11:50.710 --> 11:52.294
[choir singing indistinctly]

11:54.338 --> 11:55.339
[panting]

12:03.180 --> 12:05.850
[sighs] Could you
at least try to be more ethical?

12:06.350 --> 12:09.729
Why couldn't you just take my money
instead of meeting in a holy place?

12:11.105 --> 12:12.606
I really like this place.

12:13.566 --> 12:17.278
Makes me think your Heavenly Father
will bless this conversation.

12:23.409 --> 12:24.660
I don't have to count this?

12:25.327 --> 12:26.203
[scoffs]

12:26.287 --> 12:27.913
This bitch right here…

12:27.997 --> 12:31.375
You go off to college and now you think
you're better than everyone?

12:31.459 --> 12:32.752
[zips bag]

12:32.835 --> 12:34.170
I'll be going now, then.

12:35.296 --> 12:37.423
This arrogant bitch has somewhere to be.

12:37.923 --> 12:39.925
Hey! You won't go to heaven.

12:40.843 --> 12:42.094
But I can still go.

12:42.720 --> 12:46.557
'Cause I've been saved,
since I asked for forgiveness.

12:49.477 --> 12:50.478
[chuckles wryly]

12:52.354 --> 12:53.355
God's on your side?

12:54.857 --> 12:55.691
Funny.

12:56.984 --> 12:58.986
I hope you go there when you die,

12:59.069 --> 13:01.322
'cause you'll be in hell
while you're alive.

13:03.199 --> 13:06.118
What did you mean by that?
What else are you gonna do, huh?

13:06.202 --> 13:07.203
Let go now,

13:07.870 --> 13:10.915
or I'll call your father, the minister,
to bless the exchange between us.

13:12.958 --> 13:15.085
Hey! Hey, stop!

13:15.169 --> 13:17.171
I'm talking to you! Hey!

13:17.254 --> 13:18.255
Hey!

13:18.756 --> 13:20.883
[panting, grunting]

13:20.966 --> 13:22.593
Ah, shit!

13:22.676 --> 13:23.844
[doors fling open]

13:23.928 --> 13:24.929
[choir stops]

13:29.809 --> 13:31.393
Are we having our session here?

13:31.894 --> 13:34.021
Today, I'm having you take
an assessment test.

13:34.104 --> 13:37.483
Try. That's all you have to do.
But it'll be easy. I'll wait here.

13:37.566 --> 13:39.151
What kind of assessment?

13:40.486 --> 13:43.072
I'm gonna send you to the U.S. to study.

13:43.739 --> 13:44.907
Study abroad?

13:44.990 --> 13:47.952
Something unexpected happened,
so I can't tutor you anymore.

13:48.828 --> 13:51.247
This way, you'll have a better teacher
that you can study with.

13:51.330 --> 13:52.331
[scoffs]

13:53.332 --> 13:54.250
Oh, wow.

13:55.376 --> 13:57.294
Why would you make up a lie that now?

13:58.295 --> 14:00.548
How are you going to send me
to study abroad?

14:00.631 --> 14:02.049
Could you afford to?

14:02.132 --> 14:04.969
Yeah. I just got some money.

14:06.220 --> 14:07.388
[phone chimes]

14:08.722 --> 14:09.932
[woman] Come in, please.

14:12.142 --> 14:13.978
TAIL - DO YOU HAVE THE MONEY?

14:19.984 --> 14:21.527
[whistle blowing]

14:23.028 --> 14:25.281
That was incredible. Nice job, Ye-sol.

14:25.906 --> 14:27.408
Just like Son Heung-min.

14:32.997 --> 14:35.082
But the, uh, kid with the pink socks

14:35.958 --> 14:39.628
really doesn't seem to understand
how to play fair. Somebody could get hurt.

14:40.421 --> 14:41.422
You mean Kim Ji-uk?

14:42.214 --> 14:45.718
Oh, yeah. He always tries
and tackles everyone.

14:48.012 --> 14:48.846
Yeah?

14:48.929 --> 14:53.642
Ah! Daddy, we have
an open class next Friday, Daddy!

14:54.143 --> 14:55.603
It's just for dads.

14:55.686 --> 14:59.565
It's okay if you can't go to it.
I like you when you're busy, too.

15:01.817 --> 15:02.902
No way.

15:02.985 --> 15:04.862
Of course I'm going to go,

15:04.945 --> 15:06.238
even if I'm busy.

15:10.242 --> 15:11.327
Hey, Ye-sol.

15:12.077 --> 15:13.579
Can I ask about your teacher?

15:14.747 --> 15:18.834
Your mom doesn't seem to like her much.
Ye-sol, how about you? You like her?

15:18.918 --> 15:20.669
She's a friend. Why?

15:21.378 --> 15:22.379
Of who?

15:23.213 --> 15:24.048
Yours?

15:24.131 --> 15:26.258
No, my teacher's a friend of Mommy.

15:27.051 --> 15:29.386
They went to the same
high school together.

15:32.097 --> 15:33.307
[Hye-jeong] Ha Do-yeong?

15:33.390 --> 15:36.060
Since when do you care
about Yeon-jin's husband?

15:37.770 --> 15:39.521
Just curious what he's like.

15:39.605 --> 15:41.607
I've realized I don't know him at all.

15:41.690 --> 15:43.525
He's nice, but a son of a bitch.

15:44.276 --> 15:47.029
You always see
assholes like him in first class.

15:47.112 --> 15:50.616
They think flight attendants are
just maids who speak little English.

15:52.952 --> 15:54.036
Fuck that.

15:54.119 --> 15:56.288
You know how many applied for my job, huh?

15:56.372 --> 15:58.290
[woman] This is our latest Vera Wang.

15:58.374 --> 15:59.792
This dress has a mermaid silhouette,

15:59.875 --> 16:02.670
meaning it's perfect
for brides with a beautiful figure.

16:08.801 --> 16:11.053
Like it? Look good?

16:12.471 --> 16:13.472
Just my type.

16:14.556 --> 16:15.641
I've got a question.

16:16.350 --> 16:20.354
"Nice son of a bitch" means what, exactly?
How am I any different from that, huh?

16:20.938 --> 16:23.023
Obviously, you're a shithead.

16:24.108 --> 16:25.734
Do-yeon, on the other hand…

16:26.610 --> 16:29.113
You need to look close to know.

16:30.030 --> 16:31.740
He's not trying to be one either.

16:31.824 --> 16:34.660
It's just he's already
so used to ordering people around.

16:35.536 --> 16:36.453
Ah, I see.

16:36.537 --> 16:38.372
That's why his eyes look like that.

16:38.872 --> 16:41.458
Did you and Do-yeong meet up? Why?

16:42.042 --> 16:44.128
Does he know about you and Yeon-jin?

16:46.046 --> 16:47.047
Hye-jeong…

16:48.924 --> 16:49.758
Yeah?

16:49.842 --> 16:52.261
Even if he knew,
you still wouldn't have a chance.

16:54.388 --> 16:55.681
Take the hint already.

16:56.849 --> 16:58.809
However, that dress looks great on you.

16:59.643 --> 17:01.145
You really should get married.

17:02.438 --> 17:05.733
At your age, you'll never find another
boyfriend who'll get you a Vera Wang.

17:05.816 --> 17:08.819
And make sure to ask your boyfriend
where he had his last wedding at.

17:08.902 --> 17:10.696
Maybe they'll give you a discount,

17:10.779 --> 17:11.905
since he's a regular.

17:11.989 --> 17:12.990
[chuckles]

17:18.996 --> 17:19.830
[door opens]

17:20.330 --> 17:21.165
He's not the…?

17:21.248 --> 17:22.249
Stop!

17:22.875 --> 17:25.335
Would you like to try on
any of our other dresses?

17:27.629 --> 17:28.922
It's the most expensive?

17:29.548 --> 17:32.384
The chest is really fucking tight,
so you need to fix it!

17:34.970 --> 17:36.972
[tense, mysterious music playing]

17:49.568 --> 17:50.903
[breathing shakily]

17:50.986 --> 17:52.321
That asshole.

18:08.962 --> 18:10.631
Yeon-jin's is smaller than mine.

18:11.298 --> 18:12.257
Definitely.

18:12.758 --> 18:13.717
So what's wrong?

18:21.391 --> 18:24.144
Snow White chose
to live with seven men, did she not?

18:24.937 --> 18:25.771
Why?

18:26.647 --> 18:28.982
Because she knew
they were mining for gold.

18:29.066 --> 18:31.652
DOES ANYBODY KNOW
WHERE THAT BASTARD MYEONG-O LIVES?

18:37.407 --> 18:38.408
[Louis barking]

18:56.135 --> 18:57.302
[phone trills]

18:57.386 --> 18:58.554
[line ringing]

19:01.598 --> 19:03.308
[operator] The person
you're trying to reach…

19:03.392 --> 19:04.226
Ah, shit.

19:04.309 --> 19:06.895
[Yeon-jin] Where are you?
Definitely not at home!

19:06.979 --> 19:08.856
Did you actually meet with Do-yeong?

19:10.149 --> 19:11.900
He had your golf club's address
in his car's--

19:11.984 --> 19:12.818
[phone chimes]

19:12.901 --> 19:16.071
JAE-JUN SENT A NEW MESSAGE

19:16.155 --> 19:17.156
[sighs]

19:17.239 --> 19:19.241
[low, ominous music playing]

19:24.663 --> 19:26.874
[Jae-jun] When you're there,
can you look for my watch?

19:26.957 --> 19:28.959
34-9 Eulseo Road, Jongno-gu.

19:29.042 --> 19:30.544
Don't know his door code.

19:32.462 --> 19:33.714
[phone ringing]

19:33.797 --> 19:34.798
INCOMING CALL
JAE-JUN

19:35.591 --> 19:37.509
Why the hell are you
not answering my calls?

19:38.302 --> 19:39.928
You ignored my calls first, didn't you?

19:40.012 --> 19:42.055
I was busy. You see the text?

19:42.139 --> 19:44.183
We should meet up. Where are you?

19:44.266 --> 19:45.434
Sure, later.

19:45.517 --> 19:47.644
I'm not in Seoul. I'm at a family reunion.

19:51.648 --> 19:52.482
Ye-sol!

19:56.069 --> 19:57.571
[tense music playing]

20:01.158 --> 20:02.075
Ye-sol!

20:26.892 --> 20:28.852
[music turns ominous]

20:56.088 --> 20:57.005
I'm sorry.

20:58.090 --> 20:59.258
But I was so happy to see you.

20:59.341 --> 21:02.261
Don't worry.
I know how to cross the road, too.

21:03.178 --> 21:04.179
It's okay.

21:04.680 --> 21:06.098
Where's Mommy?

21:06.181 --> 21:09.184
Oh I just came to visit you on my own.

21:10.477 --> 21:12.771
Ah, what does Ye-sol like?

21:12.854 --> 21:15.399
Maybe video games? Dolls?

21:15.482 --> 21:18.318
Trading stocks. Samsung or even Kakao.

21:18.902 --> 21:19.778
Huh?

21:19.861 --> 21:21.196
I'm just joking.

21:21.697 --> 21:24.616
Mommy told me to say that
if anyone asked me.

21:26.201 --> 21:27.869
Ah. [chuckles]

21:28.370 --> 21:31.290
Hey, you're only eight
and you understand a joke like that?

21:31.373 --> 21:32.874
Wow, that's fucking gre…

21:35.669 --> 21:37.087
You're a very smart girl.

21:39.006 --> 21:40.799
Ah, little genius.

21:40.882 --> 21:42.968
I wonder which parent Ye-sol takes after.

21:43.719 --> 21:44.845
[car honking]

21:47.723 --> 21:49.599
Can't they tell
this is a fucking school zone?

21:49.683 --> 21:51.643
I'm going to cut off
their goddamn hands. Shit.

21:51.727 --> 21:53.395
Don't you see there's a kid, huh?

21:58.734 --> 21:59.735
[exhales]

22:02.988 --> 22:04.406
I know what I'm going to do.

22:05.657 --> 22:06.908
I've made up my mind now.

22:08.076 --> 22:09.703
From now on, I'll protect you.

22:10.579 --> 22:11.580
[chuckles]

22:13.373 --> 22:14.499
I love you, Ye-sol.

22:15.000 --> 22:16.793
[door alarm chimes]

22:17.294 --> 22:18.295
[door closes]

22:21.089 --> 22:22.716
Ugh, that smells.

22:25.218 --> 22:26.303
What happened?

22:27.721 --> 22:29.931
Did he run away or give up half-way?

22:32.517 --> 22:34.436
I can't believe this moron.

22:35.103 --> 22:37.105
He really stole this from Jae-jin?

22:39.566 --> 22:40.567
[screams]

22:43.070 --> 22:44.071
Shit!

22:44.154 --> 22:45.947
Bitch, shouldn't you be at church now?

22:46.031 --> 22:48.492
You see, I can pray
anytime, anywhere with this.

22:48.575 --> 22:51.745
I wanted to know who'd come.
Turns out it's Sister Hye-jeong.

22:51.828 --> 22:54.956
You crazy bitch.
Why do you care who comes or not

22:55.040 --> 22:58.960
Don't you know? The perpetrator will
return to the scene of their own crime,

22:59.044 --> 22:59.878
always.

22:59.961 --> 23:01.088
Oh, fuck off.

23:01.171 --> 23:03.298
So Myeong-o isn't here?

23:03.382 --> 23:05.467
-Did you make this big mess?
-Mm-hmm..

23:05.967 --> 23:07.719
Just knock,
and the door will open for you.

23:07.803 --> 23:09.554
So I knocked, and it opened wide for me.

23:09.638 --> 23:11.681
Look. My prayers are answered.

23:11.765 --> 23:12.808
Stop. Get it away.

23:12.891 --> 23:14.059
[inhales deeply]

23:14.142 --> 23:15.977
God damn it. I need to see him.

23:16.686 --> 23:18.897
If he comes to my wedding
and shows weird pictures,

23:18.980 --> 23:20.232
I'm going to be screwed.

23:20.315 --> 23:22.442
Why would he try to screw you over?

23:23.026 --> 23:24.444
Because he couldn't have me.

23:25.112 --> 23:27.114
Hey, you know what that jerk told me?

23:27.197 --> 23:30.158
No idea. Look at this.
I think he went on a trip.

23:30.242 --> 23:31.243
Trip?

23:32.536 --> 23:33.745
Vladivostok?

23:33.829 --> 23:35.247
Why are you going to Russia?

23:35.330 --> 23:38.250
Ah. You finally decided to be a dog?

23:38.333 --> 23:39.418
A little sled doggy?

23:39.501 --> 23:40.335
What?

23:41.128 --> 23:43.046
He was actually going to Russia, then?

23:44.339 --> 23:45.382
Why didn't he go?

23:45.465 --> 23:48.176
Ah, fuck me. Was I actually the reason?

23:48.260 --> 23:50.679
-He didn't go?
-You're holding his passport.

23:54.266 --> 23:56.309
-[doorbell ringing repeatedly]
-[screams]

23:56.393 --> 23:59.020
What the fuck
are you screaming for, pussy? Shit.

23:59.104 --> 24:00.981
[woman] I know you're there!
Your lights are on!

24:01.064 --> 24:03.191
Come on, open this door! [banging on door]

24:03.275 --> 24:05.110
Didn't you say you
were in a hurry to leave?

24:05.193 --> 24:08.530
Then why aren't you answering me?
I have people who want to see your room!

24:14.077 --> 24:15.662
What's wrong? What's going on?

24:15.745 --> 24:17.789
-[Sa-ra] He's dead.
-[Hye-jeong] See our message?

24:17.873 --> 24:19.749
What are you saying? Slow down a bit.

24:19.833 --> 24:21.376
Myeong-o seems to have gone missing.

24:21.460 --> 24:24.212
We went to his apartment,
and his landlord couldn't reach him.

24:24.296 --> 24:27.299
He was moving out,
and even had a plane ticket, too.

24:27.382 --> 24:29.676
-It's just weird.
-So then, call the police.

24:30.552 --> 24:32.679
You report something like that
to the police, not me.

24:32.762 --> 24:34.931
Report? Don't report?

24:35.432 --> 24:37.934
Why? All we're saying
is that it looks weird.

24:38.018 --> 24:41.688
Yeah, Sara's right.
And besides, I'm getting married soon.

24:41.771 --> 24:43.273
I can't be seen at a police station.

24:43.356 --> 24:44.858
[grunts] Then, why me?

24:45.358 --> 24:47.569
I'm supposed to be at the news van now.

24:49.237 --> 24:50.238
So then,

24:51.031 --> 24:54.576
did Myeong-o not call
either of you guys before he left?

25:03.460 --> 25:04.711
Well, I called him often.

25:05.962 --> 25:07.130
He's Jae-jun's driver.

25:09.257 --> 25:11.301
When exactly did you last talk to him?

25:11.384 --> 25:14.721
I guess sometime around the 19th or 20th.

25:15.847 --> 25:17.307
[Sa-ra] Why are you asking?

25:18.517 --> 25:21.436
[sighs] I got a weird-ass call
from him that day.

25:22.187 --> 25:24.731
[sighs] So I was wondering
if you guys did too.

25:27.192 --> 25:28.568
Like how? Why was it weird?

25:29.486 --> 25:31.071
[Sa-ra] I got a call too.

25:31.571 --> 25:34.699
You did? Tell me. What did he say to you?

25:35.825 --> 25:39.538
Nothing. Kept going on about sending
some stupid gift, so I hung up.

25:40.038 --> 25:41.456
He wasn't making any sense.

25:41.540 --> 25:43.708
[Hye-jeong] So, he gave you a gift?

25:47.128 --> 25:50.131
And I got a fucking stupid "I love you"!

25:50.215 --> 25:53.718
That son of a bitch told me he loves me
and asked me to visit him soon.

25:53.802 --> 25:55.720
Does he think I'm crazy or what?

25:56.221 --> 25:58.848
Ugh, I'm getting so pissed off
thinking about it.

25:58.932 --> 26:02.269
I mean, how dare he think he has a chance?

26:02.352 --> 26:04.145
He thinks we're on the same level?

26:04.229 --> 26:05.230
[Hye-jeong scoffs]

26:05.730 --> 26:07.732
[uproarious laughter]

26:13.822 --> 26:15.991
Tell me, what the hell
did you do to Myeong-o?

26:16.074 --> 26:18.076
to have him do something like that, huh?

26:18.577 --> 26:19.661
He's punishing you.

26:19.744 --> 26:21.746
That's so fucking funny.

26:21.830 --> 26:22.747
I'm going now.

26:23.331 --> 26:25.417
I'll be on the news truck, so don't call.

26:27.210 --> 26:28.253
It now makes sense.

26:28.336 --> 26:30.463
[Sa-ra] I was wondering
how you knew his door code.

26:30.547 --> 26:32.340
69-69-69.

26:32.424 --> 26:35.093
[Hye-jeong] And what about you?
How did you know the code?

26:35.176 --> 26:38.930
I've been there a few times. I just can't
even remember how exactly I got there.

26:39.014 --> 26:40.932
I'm sure you two would look cute together.

26:41.016 --> 26:42.851
Fuck you! It's not like that!

26:44.144 --> 26:46.146
[dark, menacing music playing]

26:47.397 --> 26:49.983
[man] Saturday at 3:00 p.m.
Locker number C-7.

26:50.066 --> 26:51.943
Passcode's 48-85.

26:54.821 --> 26:57.365
STORAGE AND DELIVERY

27:26.061 --> 27:27.062
[sighs]

27:35.487 --> 27:37.489
[somber music playing]

27:45.747 --> 27:47.999
RÉSUMÉ
AN JEONG-MI

27:48.833 --> 27:50.418
Ms. An Jeong-mi, right?

27:51.628 --> 27:54.047
Yes. It's nice to meet you.

27:54.130 --> 27:55.882
I've heard a lot about you.

27:56.466 --> 27:57.592
I'm looking forward to it.

27:57.676 --> 27:58.677
Me too.

28:00.428 --> 28:01.763
I look forward to it, too.

28:02.347 --> 28:03.598
[therapist] How are you feeling?

28:04.974 --> 28:06.351
I'm feeling pretty good.

28:06.434 --> 28:08.603
I've been sleeping well
and I'm working out.

28:09.688 --> 28:13.024
Someone told me you opened
a practice in Semyeong. Congratulations.

28:13.525 --> 28:14.442
Thank you, ma'am.

28:15.360 --> 28:17.362
I just regret
that I didn't listen to you sooner,

28:17.445 --> 28:19.406
when you said
I should change my environment.

28:19.906 --> 28:21.866
That's good. Are you eating well?

28:22.450 --> 28:24.536
Semyeong has quite a few
great restaurants.

28:25.620 --> 28:27.205
Does it still bring you comfort

28:27.288 --> 28:29.916
when you listen
to the sound of tablets dissolving?

28:33.795 --> 28:35.004
This is goodbye, ma'am.

28:36.005 --> 28:37.173
I don't think I'll be back.

28:37.882 --> 28:40.593
It's only a two-hour trip
that you'd make once a month.

28:41.094 --> 28:42.095
Is it too much?

28:43.722 --> 28:45.348
It's not because of how far it is.

28:46.808 --> 28:49.644
I've decided it's time to leave
because you weren't able to fix me at all.

28:49.728 --> 28:52.313
[suspenseful music playing]

28:55.984 --> 28:57.986
[suspenseful music intensifies]

29:24.637 --> 29:27.974
[siren echoing]

29:31.728 --> 29:34.189
[alarms beeping frantically]

29:34.272 --> 29:36.274
[indistinct shouting]

30:03.468 --> 30:06.221
[man] So what kind of shit
did you get yourself into this time?

30:06.304 --> 30:08.306
You asshole. Don't call it shit.

30:09.140 --> 30:10.308
It's not like that this time.

30:14.729 --> 30:17.398
I have something
that is very small and precious.

30:18.274 --> 30:21.194
-And I wanna take it from someone.
-What do you mean precious?

30:21.277 --> 30:24.447
A jewel?
Are you going around stealing things now?

30:24.531 --> 30:27.033
Fuck you. I'm just trying
to get back what's mine.

30:29.744 --> 30:30.662
Come on, man.

30:31.955 --> 30:32.872
Just hear me out.

30:35.166 --> 30:37.085
Right. I'll get straight to the point.

30:37.877 --> 30:39.212
No way. It's impossible.

30:39.796 --> 30:41.798
-You can't have the kid.
-And why's that?

30:42.799 --> 30:44.050
I'm Ye-sol's father, aren't I?

30:44.133 --> 30:46.386
Biologically, yeah. Not legally.

30:46.469 --> 30:48.221
When a child is born during a marriage,

30:48.304 --> 30:50.974
they are legally considered
to belong to the married couple's.

30:51.057 --> 30:52.892
That means her real father's Ha Do-yeong.

30:52.976 --> 30:54.143
[scoffs]

30:54.227 --> 30:56.020
God damn. That's not fucking fair.

30:56.104 --> 30:57.397
Even with a DNA test?

30:58.314 --> 31:02.235
-A 99% match. Isn't it science?
-Well, would you waste your time on that?

31:02.318 --> 31:05.321
Even if it was 990 instead of 99%,

31:05.405 --> 31:07.824
as long as the legal father
doesn't abandon them,

31:07.907 --> 31:09.242
you'll always be second rate.

31:10.076 --> 31:14.247
Son of a bitch. Can you at least try
and file a lawsuit or whatever? Something?

31:14.330 --> 31:16.541
I'm saying you don't even
have the grounds to file one.

31:16.624 --> 31:18.126
You're a third party, not considered--

31:18.209 --> 31:20.962
Why am I a third party?
I'm her real father. Shit.

31:21.045 --> 31:25.383
[sighs] What kind of
fucked-up law even is that?

31:26.509 --> 31:29.345
You might have a chance
for a law suit against them

31:29.429 --> 31:32.265
if it's clear that the legal guardians
were unable to have a child,

31:32.348 --> 31:34.642
like if one of them
was locked up in prison,

31:34.726 --> 31:36.185
or away on a trip when conceived.

31:36.978 --> 31:37.979
Is it possible?

31:38.938 --> 31:39.939
[sighs]

31:41.316 --> 31:43.318
It's not. They're fucking lovebirds.

31:43.401 --> 31:45.570
Then has the father abused the child?

31:46.988 --> 31:48.907
If he were abusing her,
why would I call you?

31:48.990 --> 31:50.408
I would just call the cops.

31:50.491 --> 31:51.576
Well,

31:52.702 --> 31:55.788
in this situation,
your best scenario won't be a lawsuit.

31:56.623 --> 31:57.957
It's the mother getting a divorce.

31:58.917 --> 32:01.669
Child custody would be
a whole different matter.

32:07.342 --> 32:08.384
A divorce?

32:08.468 --> 32:10.762
[Hyeon-nam] I went over
to the shaman's shop,

32:10.845 --> 32:13.014
but I haven't found
anything worthwhile yet.

32:13.765 --> 32:16.267
After I visit a few more times,
I'll get you more info.

32:17.060 --> 32:18.061
Also…

32:18.686 --> 32:20.939
So are you about to pull out more eggs?

32:21.689 --> 32:22.523
Oh, not at all!

32:24.192 --> 32:25.485
Hey look, what's that?

32:28.321 --> 32:30.281
So, that rental car?

32:31.074 --> 32:33.493
I think we may actually have something.

32:33.993 --> 32:36.371
[mischievous, dramatic music playing]

32:46.172 --> 32:48.508
After I followed them
from the storage lockers,

32:48.591 --> 32:51.594
they drove down the expressway
for what felt like forever.

32:52.095 --> 32:54.681
But then, they finally stopped at a motel.

32:58.977 --> 33:03.022
And just as I started to wonder
if I should just drive back,

33:04.148 --> 33:05.400
guess who appeared?

33:10.530 --> 33:14.325
Yeah. That's the cop who goes
to the shaman's with Yeon-jin's mom.

33:14.826 --> 33:16.285
They're all working together.

33:16.911 --> 33:17.996
That's huge, right?

33:19.497 --> 33:21.749
Wow, even now, I'm still not scared.

33:21.833 --> 33:24.752
[chuckles] It's been getting me thinking,

33:25.253 --> 33:27.255
If I ever happen to get reborn,

33:27.338 --> 33:28.339
I want to be a spy.

33:29.424 --> 33:33.386
And then I would wear red lipstick
and a cool jacket, too.

33:33.469 --> 33:37.056
If you want, you could put on
red lipstick in this lifetime, too.

33:37.140 --> 33:39.851
-[laughs] Oh, you think?
-But regarding Son Myeong-o,

33:39.934 --> 33:41.310
I don't think he just went missing.

33:41.394 --> 33:43.813
Oh, me wear red lipstick? [laughs]

33:45.606 --> 33:47.442
Wait, you don't think he went missing?

33:47.525 --> 33:49.569
Do you think Son Myeong-o…

33:49.652 --> 33:53.281
That he actually… was murdered?

33:54.907 --> 33:58.161
Those people might be
Park Yeon-jin's hired thugs

33:58.661 --> 33:59.912
who work outside the law.

33:59.996 --> 34:02.248
Park Yeon-jin doesn't have
an in with the police.

34:02.331 --> 34:04.834
Rather, it's that
they rely on her influence.

34:06.377 --> 34:09.547
Hold on, wait. "Outside the law."
Do you mean that…

34:10.506 --> 34:13.968
Yeah. Son Myeong-o disappeared
because of them.

34:15.887 --> 34:18.973
Myeong-o went off on his own
because he didn't trust me,

34:19.057 --> 34:20.808
and since he bought a plane ticket…

34:21.559 --> 34:24.145
that means he must have met with Yeon-jin.

34:25.146 --> 34:26.189
Then he disappeared.

34:26.272 --> 34:27.482
[gasps]

34:27.565 --> 34:29.484
So what should we do now?

34:33.237 --> 34:36.240
What did you really want
from that Son Myeong-o, ma'am?

34:39.911 --> 34:40.912
[sighs]

34:42.288 --> 34:44.290
But now we're together in the same boat.

34:44.874 --> 34:47.960
Which one of those four killed So-hee?

34:48.044 --> 34:50.046
[mysterious music playing]

34:55.968 --> 34:57.053
Park Yeong-jin.

35:02.892 --> 35:03.726
Yes!

35:05.019 --> 35:05.853
Hold on…

35:07.105 --> 35:10.108
I'm sure Yeon-jin already knows
she's at that hospital.

35:11.859 --> 35:14.862
Do you have proof?
How can you prove she did it?

35:19.117 --> 35:22.120
So-hee has this tag
in her hand when she fell that day.

35:22.203 --> 35:25.123
PARK YEON-JIN

35:29.001 --> 35:30.378
How do you have this thing?

35:33.589 --> 35:34.841
That day, you there, huh?

35:36.759 --> 35:38.261
And now, you were there with me.

35:42.682 --> 35:44.350
Because we're in this together, right?

35:45.393 --> 35:46.227
Wow.

35:47.645 --> 35:48.646
Wow, fuck yeah!

35:52.441 --> 35:55.153
[muffled laughter]

35:55.236 --> 35:56.404
This is crazy.

35:57.697 --> 35:59.365
Hey, so, a billion won?

35:59.448 --> 36:02.118
Call me when you arrange
a meeting with Park Yeon-jin.

36:02.201 --> 36:03.953
And on that day,
I'll give you the name tag.

36:06.747 --> 36:10.293
Not matter the price you give,
that money will be all yours.

36:12.753 --> 36:14.255
I want something else.

36:15.131 --> 36:17.133
What do you want? Tell me now.

36:19.093 --> 36:20.261
Yeon-jin's confession.

36:22.096 --> 36:24.098
If it worked and Myeong-o got the money,

36:24.932 --> 36:26.058
that would've been it.

36:27.059 --> 36:30.980
He told me that he would record
every single step for me.

36:34.025 --> 36:38.404
Didn't you say that it was
declared as a suicide?

36:39.322 --> 36:41.324
Do you think it could change things?

36:42.867 --> 36:45.203
And that's why I wanted
to make her an outcast.

36:46.746 --> 36:48.748
I wouldn't have the legal advantage.

36:48.831 --> 36:50.666
I thought I'd let the world know

36:51.500 --> 36:53.836
exactly what she did
by hearing her confession.

36:55.963 --> 36:59.008
I want her to burn
for the rest of eternity,

36:59.884 --> 37:01.385
oozing pus from her wounds.

37:02.303 --> 37:05.640
She'd never be able to laugh,
and she'd never have peace again.

37:09.101 --> 37:13.231
But can you even get
Park Yeon-jin's confession at this point?

37:15.066 --> 37:18.194
It's not like we can
go looking for Myeong-o's body.

37:18.694 --> 37:19.779
So what now?

37:20.738 --> 37:21.739
[sighs]

37:22.949 --> 37:24.242
We'll have to find him first.

37:25.368 --> 37:26.285
But how?

37:27.286 --> 37:28.704
Please keep still.

37:32.500 --> 37:33.501
[breathes shakily]

37:35.253 --> 37:38.130
What exactly will this exam tell me?

37:38.214 --> 37:41.425
[doctor] It's a 12-panel STD test,
so it will catch most things.

37:41.509 --> 37:43.678
An HPV test was also added here,

37:43.761 --> 37:46.222
so you can be better-informed.

37:46.305 --> 37:47.640
Nothing else, though?

37:48.224 --> 37:49.809
That's all that'll show, right?

37:52.436 --> 37:54.480
Here are the documents you requested.

37:54.563 --> 37:57.233
My family's genealogy map,
my college transcripts,

37:57.316 --> 37:59.026
my OB-GYN exam.

37:59.777 --> 38:01.112
You could've emailed this.

38:01.195 --> 38:03.197
Nobody carries paper copies anymore.

38:04.198 --> 38:05.950
That's fine. I'll look at these later.

38:07.910 --> 38:09.996
-What bank do you primarily use?
-Sorry?

38:10.079 --> 38:11.706
There's no way that I'll be able to stand

38:11.789 --> 38:13.624
looking at a bank account
with so many zeros.

38:13.708 --> 38:14.834
Just give me the name.

38:14.917 --> 38:16.294
I'll take care of the rest.

38:16.377 --> 38:18.379
[gasps] Is that Ms. Moon?

38:18.462 --> 38:20.256
[laughs] Ms. Moon, dear!

38:21.841 --> 38:24.385
Oh! It's so great to see you!

38:24.468 --> 38:25.720
How long's it been?

38:27.138 --> 38:28.723
You're even prettier now!

38:33.394 --> 38:34.395
Choi Hye-jeong?

38:34.895 --> 38:37.690
[mysterious music playing]

38:38.733 --> 38:41.694
You know each other?
This is my son's girlfriend.

38:41.777 --> 38:44.530
Ah, the two of us went to school together.

38:44.613 --> 38:46.365
-Ah.
-[Dong-eun sighs]

38:46.449 --> 38:49.118
I guess I shouldn't make her jealous
'cause I'm friends with you.

38:49.201 --> 38:50.911
No! What are you saying?

38:50.995 --> 38:53.205
What she does has
nothing at all to do with you.

38:53.706 --> 38:55.124
Don't make me cry, dear.

38:55.624 --> 38:57.752
We're getting dinner ready
over at the temple.

38:57.835 --> 39:00.087
If you're available, Ms. Moon,
you should come join us.

39:00.171 --> 39:01.672
I'm sorry, I have plans later.

39:03.674 --> 39:05.009
So you're getting married?

39:06.052 --> 39:07.053
Congrats.

39:12.892 --> 39:15.436
The next time I visit,
I'll try to be here earlier, okay?

39:15.895 --> 39:17.772
Okay, that sounds good. I'll see you.

39:22.026 --> 39:24.195
I really wish she was Tae-uk's wife.

39:30.409 --> 39:31.911
Ugh, I'm stuck with this brat!

39:33.579 --> 39:36.332
How come you didn't go and say hello, hmm?

39:36.415 --> 39:38.084
Ms. Moon looked very happy to see you.

39:41.087 --> 39:44.173
I just wasn't expecting her.
We weren't really that close.

39:45.633 --> 39:47.134
I'm sorry. Just a moment.

39:53.974 --> 39:56.227
Hey, Dong-eun!

39:57.019 --> 39:59.271
I'm so sorry we didn't get
a chance to talk back there.

39:59.355 --> 40:03.025
[chuckles] It's too funny,
running into you out here.

40:03.109 --> 40:04.402
Great seeing you.

40:06.237 --> 40:08.823
Can we talk real quick? Huh?

40:12.243 --> 40:13.077
Okay.

40:18.082 --> 40:19.792
What the hell have you been doing?

40:20.793 --> 40:22.211
Why won't you pick up your phone?

40:22.920 --> 40:24.797
You have any idea how many times I called?

40:24.880 --> 40:25.923
Seventeen times.

40:27.341 --> 40:28.426
By the way, Yeon-jin,

40:29.927 --> 40:32.012
isn't there something
you'd like to tell me?

40:32.596 --> 40:33.597
Like what?

40:35.224 --> 40:36.851
Why were you and Do-yeong together?

40:37.435 --> 40:40.563
-You really have nothing to tell me?
-Don't change the subject!

40:41.063 --> 40:43.441
Who arranged the meeting first?
You or Do-yeong?

40:44.316 --> 40:45.317
[wry chuckle]

40:51.449 --> 40:53.075
I didn't ask him to see me.

40:55.703 --> 40:59.039
Your Do-yeong came to me first
asking where the fuck Myeong-o was,

40:59.123 --> 41:00.583
so answer me right now!

41:03.961 --> 41:05.671
You really have nothing to say to me?

41:07.465 --> 41:08.466
To you?

41:09.925 --> 41:12.178
Like how Dong-eun is Ye-sol's teacher?

41:12.887 --> 41:13.971
[chuckles]

41:15.055 --> 41:17.808
So, I didn't know that.
I'm looking for something else.

41:17.892 --> 41:19.059
Then say it, would you?

41:20.811 --> 41:22.229
Just tell me exactly what I'm--

41:22.897 --> 41:23.898
[choking]

41:27.359 --> 41:28.527
Are you crazy?!

41:28.611 --> 41:29.612
No.

41:30.613 --> 41:31.780
You're who's crazy.

41:31.864 --> 41:33.741
How dare you raise
my daughter as Do-yeong's?

41:34.992 --> 41:35.993
Answer me this.

41:36.577 --> 41:39.205
Did you find out she was mine
after you gave birth?

41:40.164 --> 41:42.875
Or you already knew
she was Jeon Ye-sol, not Ha Ye-Sol?

41:45.211 --> 41:46.587
Honestly, I'm just curious.

41:48.714 --> 41:52.009
I just want to know why you stayed married
even though you had my daughter,

41:52.092 --> 41:53.177
why you abandoned me,

41:54.136 --> 41:55.721
if you knew the truth.

41:57.056 --> 41:58.057
Did…

42:01.018 --> 42:02.144
you ever love me?

42:03.312 --> 42:04.605
[wails]

42:07.191 --> 42:10.027
If I burst a blood vein, I can't go on TV!

43:03.872 --> 43:07.334
[overlapping chatter]

43:09.461 --> 43:12.006
[man] Hi, honey!
You having fun? That looks great.

43:25.436 --> 43:26.770
[man 2] Seo-u! Seo-u.

43:35.696 --> 43:39.199
Seeing each other a lot.
[laughs] We'll be friends pretty soon.

43:40.284 --> 43:41.285
Why are you here?

43:44.955 --> 43:46.832
Turns out I have a secret love child.

43:49.918 --> 43:50.919
[laughs]

43:51.420 --> 43:52.338
I'm just kidding.

43:53.547 --> 43:55.007
Just came to see a friend.

44:00.471 --> 44:01.805
I'm not here for you.

44:04.892 --> 44:06.769
[dramatic, suspenseful music playing]

44:19.448 --> 44:20.783
It's nice to meet you all.

44:21.283 --> 44:24.119
I'm the homeroom teacher,
Ms. Moon Dong-eun.

44:25.454 --> 44:27.456
[applause]

44:29.875 --> 44:31.794
[Jae-jun] We went to the same high school.

44:32.753 --> 44:34.755
Moon Dong-eun. The homeroom teacher.

44:41.929 --> 44:46.392
I heard Yeon-jin went
to the same high school as you.

44:47.559 --> 44:48.727
Yeon-jin told you that?

44:49.561 --> 44:50.979
Those two weren't friends.

44:51.563 --> 44:53.357
But I'm guessing she was friends with you?

44:53.440 --> 44:54.525
[chuckles]

44:54.608 --> 44:58.278
Well, you might even say
we could see each other's true side.

44:59.655 --> 45:01.156
I know everything about her.

45:01.240 --> 45:04.368
Huh. Even what she looks like
under her clothes.

45:09.998 --> 45:12.960
Hey, I've been so curious about something.

45:15.170 --> 45:16.171
Have you

45:18.382 --> 45:20.217
ever had something taken from you?

45:35.649 --> 45:37.985
[Dong-eun] Now,
let's begin class for the day.

45:40.654 --> 45:42.656
[dramatic music continuing]

45:45.617 --> 45:47.619
[brooding pop song playing]
